{%- comment -%}
  Outputs a product's Okendo review count as a raw number, 0 when never synced.

  Reads okendo.summaryData.reviewCount and falls back to the legacy okendo.ReviewCount
  key, matching the aggregateRating markup in sections/main-product.liquid.

  The reviews section remaps the undaria-algae-body-oil-v2 widget to a different Okendo
  product id, so the count is read from that product too — its own metafield is unrelated.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object

  Usage — the snippet echoes a raw number, so capture it and coerce it back to one:

    {%- capture review_count -%}{%- render 'product-review-count', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign review_count = review_count | plus: 0 -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign reviews_product = product
  if product.handle == 'undaria-algae-body-oil-v2'
    assign reviews_product = all_products['undaria-algae-oil']
  endif

  assign review_count = reviews_product.metafields.okendo.summaryData.reviewCount | default: reviews_product.metafields.okendo.ReviewCount | default: 0

  echo review_count
-%}
